# Production signing material -- NEVER commit these to git.
#
# key.properties holds plaintext keystore/key passwords, and *.jks/*.p12/
# *.keystore are the actual private signing key. In this project both are
# provisioned only:
#   - locally, by a developer copying their own securely-held keystore in, or
#   - in CI, by the "Decode signing key" step in
#     .github/workflows/flutter-build.yml, which reconstructs them at build
#     time from GitHub Actions repository secrets and never persists them
#     back into the repository.
key.properties
app/*.jks
app/*.keystore
app/*.p12
